body:
Refs #58
Related: #66. Issue #70 was reviewed and intentionally omitted from the figures because its optional export reconstruction is not part of the operational architecture.

## What changed

- simplified the technical harness into three layers: Author authority, orchestration, and issue-scoped implementation/assurance;
- retained only the non-trivial runtime controls that shaped parallel Lean work;
- separated semantic feedback to the Author from technical feedback to implementation;
- simplified the companion figure to Author, ChatGPT decision support, and GitHub-mediated execution;
- removed both evidence lanes, the release/attestation sequence, detailed gate inventory, and export-linkage machinery;
- rerouted all arrows through dedicated lanes and replaced the cramped assurance arrows with one clear convergence arrow.

## Scope and status

This is **draft artwork approved for merge as a package**, not final manuscript artwork. It remains subject to subsequent scientific-owner selection and refinement. No manuscript prose or figure insertion is changed.

## Validation

- SVG files parsed as XML;
- PDF and PNG previews rendered with Inkscape;
- PDFs re-rendered with Poppler and inspected at full resolution;
- checked for clipping, text overlap, crossed paths, and crushed arrowheads.
